# Mobile (KMP)

- Shared business logic and networking live in `mobile/sharedLogic`, consumed
  by `mobile/androidApp` (Compose) and `mobile/iosApp` (native SwiftUI).
- `mobile/sharedUI` is optional Compose Multiplatform scaffolding — prefer the
  pattern already used on the screen you are touching.
- Mobile and backend are **two Gradle builds**. They share no Gradle code —
  only `contracts/openapi.yaml`.
- API clients in `sharedLogic` stay aligned with the OpenAPI contract. Never
  add a parallel HTTP client for the same endpoint.
- Tests (from `mobile/`):
  `./gradlew :sharedLogic:testAndroidHostTest :androidApp:assembleDebug`
- Token outputs (`UiTokens.kt`, `UiTokens.swift`) are generated from
  `design-tokens/tokens.json` — do not edit them by hand.
